WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,020
Rainbow Dash, stop crying

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:07,920
It’s okay for Grandpa to eat steamed buns

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:13,330
Taking Rainbow Dash to dinner now is a bit awkward to keep up with others.

4
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:14,690
It would be cute to have a baby

5
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,090
It's my biological child

6
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,290
He's your own brother

7
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:29,020
I won't disturb your family of three. I'm eating my brother's sparrow in the car.

8
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,220
And such a big baby?

9
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,340
Rainbow Dash can't live without him

10
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:34,380
He said he wanted to take Rainbow Dash around the business

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,180
Then let's catch up quickly. We'll pick up a bag and pay a bill later.

12
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,000
Rainbow Dash’s diaper technicians are all here.

13
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:46,010
Your neck was scratched three times by the elf bird and rolled down.

14
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,450
You take a taxi back first

15
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:48,690
Let’s see what’s for dinner.

16
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:51,490
What do you mean if I bring them back for dinner later?

17
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:52,530
I really became a nanny

18
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:54,410
Do you get paid as a nanny?

19
00:00:58,910 --> 00:00:59,910
Brother, I will

20
00:01:00,030 --> 00:01:01,150
I Dang Dang Dang Dang

21
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:03,790
If the old man doesn’t give me money, I also ask all my buddies not to borrow money.

22
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:05,350
The old slave will go back and prepare now

23
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,310
sumptuous dinner
